  triage:resolutionNote "Content-verified fixed on feature/ay3-herdr-endpoint-doctor-config: git show c8bfb76e3:crates/atm-herdr/src/transport_cli.rs shows decode_envelope's serde_json::from_str now maps its error via .map_err(|error| HerdrError::ProtocolMismatch { message: format!(\"failed to decode Herdr response: {error}\") }), preserving the parse diagnostic. Matches commit 52321871b ('fix(herdr): preserve protocol mismatch diagnostics'), verified by QA-AY3-R3 (PASS 0/0/0 at b8afa814f) and QA-AY3-R4 (FAIL only on AY3-QA-002 at c8bfb76e3). Finding-level status set to fixed_partial, not fixed: PR #1273 has not merged to integrate/phase-ay, and the integrate occurrence (WK2) remains open." .

